# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# AI workflows and AI-related files are LOCAL ONLY.
#
# Never commit or push agent configuration/tooling, agent instruction files,
# AI task prompts, AI-generated contracts, or AI analysis reports. They stay on
# disk so the agent can use them, but they are not part of the product
# repository or its history. Anything the product must know lives in source,
# migrations, or a human-authored doc under docs/.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

